{%- comment -%}
  Brand fonts from the Figma design:
    - Display / headings: "OT Jubilee" (Diamond)
    - Body / UI:          "Neue Haas Grotesk Display Pro" (45 Light, 55 Roman)

  Both are commercial fonts, so they are not bundled. When you have the web licence:
    1. Upload the .woff2 files in Shopify admin > Content > Files, using the exact names below.
    2. Theme settings > Typography > tick "Use licensed brand fonts".
  Until then the theme falls back to Cormorant Garamond + Helvetica Neue, which sit close to the design.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.use_licensed_fonts -%}
  <style>
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'OT Jubilee';
      src: url('{{ 'OTJubilee-Diamond.woff2' | file_url }}') format('woff2');
      font-weight: 400;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Neue Haas Grotesk Display Pro';
      src: url('{{ 'NeueHaasDisplay-Light.woff2' | file_url }}') format('woff2');
      font-weight: 300;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Neue Haas Grotesk Display Pro';
      src: url('{{ 'NeueHaasDisplay-Roman.woff2' | file_url }}') format('woff2');
      font-weight: 400;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
    }
  </style>
{%- else -%}
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
{%- endif -%}
